IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-A01.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(8).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(8).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 SRC PIC S9(3)V9(3) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
01 DST PIC S9(3)V9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE 1.235 TO SRC
    MOVE SRC TO DST
    DISPLAY SRC DST
    MOVE -1.235 TO SRC
    ADD SRC TO DST END-ADD
    DISPLAY SRC DST
    MOVE -0.001 TO SRC
    MOVE SRC TO DST
    DISPLAY SRC DST
    STOP RUN.
